OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial plaques and urns worth   
OL,4,A#20k stolen from cemetery              
OL,6,FMemorial plaques and grave ornaments   
OL,7,Fworth more than #20,000 have been      
OL,8,Fstolen from a cemetery in Stockport.   
OL,10,FA volunteer at St Mark's Church in     
OL,11,FBredbury discovered about 94 cast-iron 
OL,12,Fmemorial plaques and 80 stone and      
OL,13,Fgranite flower urns had been stolen at 
OL,14,Fabout 05:30 GMT on Monday.             
OL,16,FGreater Manchester Police said the     
OL,17,Ftotal estimated value of the stolen    
OL,18,Fitems is in excess of #20,000, adding  
OL,19,F"this figure may increase as further   
OL,20,Ffamilies visit the churchyard and      
OL,21,Freport additional missing items".      
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
