OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial plaques and urns worth   
OL,4,A#20k stolen from cemetery              
OL,6,F"You just can't believe it," Reverend  
OL,7,FAndy Bull said. "For the plaques to    
OL,8,Fhave disappeared - the sentimental     
OL,9,Fvalue of that is huge to people."      
